ctricity price hedging through double-sided difference contracts for nuclear power investments, distributing risks and profits between the state and nuclear power companies."}, "subtopics": ["kärnkraft", "energi", "klimat", "statligt stöd", "finansiering"], "parties_involved": ["S", "V", "C", "MP"]}}